{"speciesId":182,"names":{"fr":"Joliflor","es":"Bellossom","en":"Bellossom","ja":"キレイハナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"BELLOSSOM gather at times and appear to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When these dance together, their petals rub against each other, making pretty, relaxing sounds."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When BELLOSSOM gets exposed to plenty of sunlight, the leaves ringing its body begin to spin around. This POKéMON’s dancing is renowned in the southern lands."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"A BELLOSSOM grows flowers more beautifully if it has evolved from a smelly GLOOM - the stinkier the better. At night, this POKéMON closes its petals and goes to sleep."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its flower petals deepen in color through exposure to sunlight. When cloudy weather persists, it does a dance that is thought to be a ritual for summoning the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"BELLOSSOM gather at times and appear to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"BELLOSSOM gather at times and seem to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"À la fin de la saison des pluies, il sort danser en plein air, attiré par la chaleur du soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"À la fin de la saison des pluies, il sort danser en plein air, attiré par la chaleur du soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les Joliflor se réunissent souvent pour danser. On pense que c’est un rituel pour appeler le soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los Bellossom suelen reunirse para bailar. Dicen que sus danzas son un ritual para invocar al sol."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Bellossom gather at times and seem to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ときおり キレイハナが 集まって 踊るような 仕草を みせる。 太陽を呼ぶ 儀式と いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"À la fin de la saison des pluies, il sort danser en plein air, attiré par la chaleur du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando acaba la estación de las lluvias, sale al sol e inicia una peculiar danza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大雨の 季節が 終わると 暖かい 日差しに 誘われた キレイハナが 踊りはじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque Joliflor reste exposé à la lumière du soleil, les feuilles autour de son corps se mettent à tournoyer. La danse de ce Pokémon est très célèbre dans les régions du sud."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando Bellossom se expone a gran cantidad de luz solar, le empiezan a girar las hojas que le rodean. La danza de este Pokémon es famosa en las zonas del sur."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Bellossom gets exposed to plenty of sunlight, the leaves ringing its body begin to spin around. This Pokémon’s dancing is renowned in the southern lands."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"太陽の 光を いっぱい 浴びると 体の 葉っぱが くるくる 回り 始める。 キレイハナの ダンスは 南国の 名物だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les fleurs de Joliflor sont encore plus jolies s’il s’agit d’une évolution d’un Ortide qui sentait vraiment très mauvais. La nuit, ce Pokémon ferme ses pétales pour dormir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La belleza de las flores que le crecen a Bellossom depende de lo mal que oliera el Gloom a partir del cual evolucionó. A mayor hedor, mayor belleza. Por la noche, este Pokémon cierra los pétalos y se echa a dormir."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Bellossom grows flowers more beautifully if it has evolved from a smelly Gloom—the more stinky the better. At night, this Pokémon closes its petals and goes to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"より 臭い クサイハナから 進化した ほうが きれいな 花を つけた キレイハナに なるよ。 夜に なると 花びらを つぼめて 眠る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon vit en nombre dans les tropiques. Quand il danse, ses pétales frottent les uns contre les autres et émettent un son mélodieux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Abunda en los trópicos. Al bailar, sus pétalos se rozan y emiten un agradable sonido."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"南国に 多く 生息する。 踊るとき 花びらが 触れあい 心地よい 音が 鳴り響く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Joliflor se réunissent parfois pour danser. On pense que c’est un rituel pour invoquer le soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Los Bellossom se reúnen en ocasiones para ejecutar una especie de danza, considerada un ritual para invocar al sol."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Bellossom gather at times and appear to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ときおり キレイハナが 集まって 踊るような しぐさを みせる。 太陽を呼ぶ 儀式と 言われる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":182,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"acid","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-